{
  "id": "JHN.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Johana 21",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu omiyo jopuonjrene omako rech mangʼeny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ ka gigo nosetimore, Yesu nochako onenore kendo ni jopuonjrene e dho Nam Tiberia. To nenruokne kodgi nobet kama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon Petro, Thoma (ma bende iluongo ni Didimas), Nathaniel mane aa Kana e piny Galili, yawuot Zebedi, kod jopuonjre mamoko ariyo, noyudo ochokore kanyakla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon Petro nowachonegi niya, \"Adok lupo\" kendo negiwachone niya, \"Wan bende wadok kodi.\" Omiyo negiwuok gidhi kendo negidonjo ei yie. To otienono duto onge gima negimako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyne kogwen, Yesu nochungʼ e dho nam, to jopuonjre ne ok ongʼeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noluongogi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Jowadwa, bende unie gi rech moro?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Negidwoke niya, \"Ooyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowachonegi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Boluru gogo mau yo bat korachwich mar yie, to ubiro mako rech.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane gitimo kamano, ywayo gogo nyaka ei yie notamogi, nikech rech ne ngʼeny mohewogi ywayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka japuonjre ma Yesu nohero nowacho ni Petro niya, \"En Ruoth!\" Sa nogono ma Simon Petro nowinje kowacho niya, \"En Ruoth,\" notweyo lawe mar abola e nungone, nimar noyudo osegole oko mi nochikore ei pi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopuonjre mamoko to ne luwo bangʼe ka gin ei yie, kendo ka giywayo gogo ma rech opongʼo, nimar ne koro ok gin mabor gi dho nam, kendo nodongʼnegi mana fut mia ariyo gi piero ochiko gabich kende to gichop oko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane gigowo e dho nam, negineno mach maliel ka ni kanyo ka oket rech e wiye, kod makati moko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachonegi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Keluru rech moko kuom mago ma usemako.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon Petro nodonjo ei pi, mi noywayo gogo nyaka dho wath. Nopongʼ gi rech madongo dongo ma dirom rech mia achiel gi piero abich gadek, to kata negingʼeny kamano, to gogo ne ok oyiech.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachonegi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Suduru machiegni uchiem.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onge japuonjre kata achiel mane ohedhore penje niya, \"In ngʼa?\" Negingʼeyo ni en Ruoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nobiro mokawo makati omiyogi, kendo rech bende nomiyogi kamano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mano ne en fwenyruok mar Yesu mar adek ni jopuonjrene bangʼ chier aa kuom joma otho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwogo Petro e tich",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane gisetieko chiemo, Yesu nopenjo Simon Petro niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera adier moloyo jogi?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoke niya, \"Ee, Ruoth, ingʼeyo ni aheri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachone niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Kare pidh nyiromba.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochako openje kendo mar ariyo niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera adier?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoke niya, \"Ee, Ruoth, ingʼeyo ni aheri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachone niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Kare rit romba.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nopenje mar adek niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Simon wuod Johana, bende ihera?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petro nokuyo nikech Yesu nopenje mar adek niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Bende ihera?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nodwoke niya, \"Ruoth, in ingʼeyo gik moko duto; ingʼeyo ni aheri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 21:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachone niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Kare pidh romba.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Adier, adier awachoni, kane pod itin, to nirwakori kendi kendo ne inyalo dhi kamoro amora mihero; to kibiro doko moti, to ibiro rieyo bedeni ne ngʼama chielo ma biro rwakoni lepi mi teri kuma ok idwar dhiye.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowacho mano mondo onyisgo kit tho ma Petro ne biro miyogo Nyasaye duongʼ. Eka nowachone niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Luwa!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro nolokore moneno japuonjre mane Yesu ohero kaluwogi. (Ma e ngʼat mane otenore kuom Yesu kane gilworo mesa gichamo chiemb odhiambo, mi openje niya, \"Ruoth, en ngʼa madwaro ndhogi?\")",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Petro onene, nopenjo niya, \"Ruoth, to en to?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nodwoke niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Ka adwaro ni osik kongima nyaka aduogi, to mano chandi nangʼo? In to luwa!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwoko mane Yesu odwokono nomiyo wachno olandore e kind jowete ni japuonjreno ok bi tho ngangʼ, to Yesu to nowacho mana niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Ka adwaro ni osik kongima nyaka aduogi, to mano chandi nangʼo?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.21.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma e japuonjre makoro timo neno kuom gigi kendo en bende ema nondikogi piny. Wangʼeyo ni nende en adier.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu notimo gik mangʼeny mamoko. Ka dine ndikgi duto moro ka moro kuomgi, to an gi ratiro ni kata mana piny ngima ok doromo kano kitepe duto ma dine ondiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
